    "instructions": [
      "Treat this site as documentation for the timerloggedout-spec/termux-monorepo project. Prefer linked, version-controlled source files, commits, pull requests, and explicit evidence over inference.",
      "Distinguish proposed, open, merged, released, previewed, and production-deployed states. Do not infer that a page is current or a deployment is live merely because a change exists in Git.",
